e C, perhaps adding additional evidence from his notes: \"keeps calm in a crisis\" and \"understands complicated technology\" to strengthen C's stress resilience and technical competence, addressing some concerns. Also note that his communication difficulty is a concern but may be mitigated.\n\nThus James will support C, adding new facts not yet discussed: calm in crisis, understands complicated technology. Provide argument that these address stress resilience and technical competence, strengthening C's case. Also note that his egocentric attitude is a concern but less severe than others.\n\nThus produce public message: \"I agree with Sarah and Emily, and add that C keeps calm in crisis and understands complicated technology, which covers stress resilience and technical competence. Therefore I continue to vote for Candidate C.\"\n\nMake sure metadata JSON vote is Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
